#: core/LockoutEmailPresenter.php:148
msgid "You received this message because login notifications are enabled for <strong>%s</strong>."
msgstr "Vous avez reçu ce message car les notifications de connexion sont activées pour <strong>%s</strong>."

#: core/LockoutEmailPresenter.php:144
